{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|la|Constantinus}}, the name of Roman emperors, {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|constans||constant, steadfast}}. {{doublet|en|Konstadinos}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|en|/ˈkɒns.tənˌtaɪn/}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|en|/ˈkɒns.tənˌtiːn/}}

